<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<section xml:id="sec-section-AROC" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>AROC</title>

  <p> Introduce the Average Rates of Change </p>

  <outcomes>
    <ul>
      <li>Compute average rates of change.  </li>
      <li>Approximate an instantaneous rate of change.</li>
      <li>Interpret the average velocity physically in terms of motion and graphically as the slope of a secant line.</li>
      <li>Interpret the instantaneous velocity physically in terms of motion and graphically as the slope of a tangent line.</li>
      <li>Estimate instantaneous velocity graphically using secant lines.</li>
      <li>Estimate instantaneous velocity graphically by drawing a line tangent to the graph at a specific point and computing its slope.</li>
      <li>Estimate instantaneous velocity for a function at a point numerically by computing the difference quotient for several values of h.</li>
    </ul>
  </outcomes>
  

</section>